   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/pp1ppp1p/2N2np1/8/2P1P3/8/PP3PPP/RNBQKB1R b KQkq - 0 6",
   "line": [
    "Nxc6"
   ],
   "spoken": "The first trap begins here: capturing on c6 is the tempting error. Black recaptures and the queenside opens in Black's favour.",
   "kind": "trap",
   "teaches": "In the Maróczy, an early capture on c6 concedes the b-file and hands Black the initiative.",
   "plans": "Recapture toward the centre and watch for the e5 push."
  },
  {
   "ply": 12,
   "t": 2911.5,
   "fen": "r1bqkb1r/p2ppp1p/2p2np1/8/2P1P3/8/PP3PPP/RNBQKB1R w KQkq - 0 7",
