   "spoken": "After the knights come off and White develops with the knight to c3, the trade has favoured Black: the c6-pawn is now a fine positional asset, cramping White and leaving Black a comfortable, semi-open b-file.",
   "kind": "main",
   "teaches": "Recapturing with the b-pawn turns a doubled pawn into a central clamp plus an open file.",
